+
+- **US1 (P1)**: None beyond Foundational; produces IA and redirects consumed by US2/US3.
+- **US2 (P2)**: Should align with IA/terminology from US1.
+- **US3 (P3)**: Should align with IA/terminology from US1; can proceed after US1.
